flowchart TD
    Request[User Request] --> Kernel[K.E.R.N.E.L.]
    Kernel --> Classify[Risk Classification]
    Classify --> Safe{Approval Required?}
    Safe -- No --> Execute[Execute Approved Task]
    Safe -- Yes --> Approval[Human Approval]
    Approval --> Execute
    Execute --> Log[Log Result]
    Log --> Validate[Validate Outcome]
    Validate --> Summary[Report Summary]
